WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.489 --> 00:00:06.509
Yesterday was Veterans Day, a somber day on
which we remember those who gave time from

00:00:06.509 --> 00:00:09.620
their lives to serve in the military.

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:12.130
And I have said this before.

00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:19.779
I think what you want about the missions our
military is sent on, that's a political issue.

00:00:19.779 --> 00:00:27.230
And I often disagree with the missions our
military is sent on, but I never ignore or

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:31.179
miss that we don't have a draft in this country.

00:00:31.179 --> 00:00:36.930
And I didn't have to do any military stuff
because enough people volunteered to do it.

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:40.960
Now, it's a perfectly fair criticism to say,
well, the problem is the people volunteering

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:46.420
to do it are not diverse enough in terms of
political background and whatever.

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:50.360
You know, when it's volunteer only, you get
a certain type of people in the military.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:51.920
That's a conversation we can have.

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:55.390
We can say there are certain folks not well
enough represented among the military.

00:00:55.390 --> 00:00:59.780
The military is preying on people of color.

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:01.240
Fine, fine.

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:08.390
But I remain thrilled that I didn't have to
do anything in the military because enough

00:01:08.390 --> 00:01:09.600
people are volunteering.

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:12.080
So it's a somber day, you know, etc..

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:17.590
Joe Biden tweeted a message of sober respect,
saying, quote, Today, we honor the service

00:01:17.590 --> 00:01:22.759
of those who have worn the uniform of the
armed forces of the United States to our proud

00:01:22.759 --> 00:01:23.759
veterans.

00:01:23.759 --> 00:01:28.249
I will be a commander in chief who respects
your sacrifice, understands your service,

00:01:28.249 --> 00:01:31.210
and will never betray the values you fought
so bravely to defend.

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:32.460
That's Biden.

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:37.719
Donald Trump, meanwhile, much like on Veterans
Day in years past, made it all about himself.

00:01:37.719 --> 00:01:42.679
And yesterday it was conspiracy theories about
how he really won the election and how he

00:01:42.679 --> 00:01:44.499
really won the state of Pennsylvania.

00:01:44.499 --> 00:01:50.679
Trump tweeting, quote, A guy named Al Schmidt,
a Philadelphia commissioner and so-called

00:01:50.679 --> 00:01:57.479
Republican RINO is being used big time by
the fake news media to explain how honest

00:01:57.479 --> 00:02:00.979
things were with respect to the election in
Philadelphia.

00:02:00.979 --> 00:02:06.049
He refuses to look at the mountain of corruption
and dishonesty.

00:02:06.049 --> 00:02:07.490
We win.

00:02:07.490 --> 00:02:14.680
Now, aside from the, again, completely disrespectful
nature of Donald Trump doing this on Veterans

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:20.010
Day, as a reminder, the closer we get to one
hundred percent of the Pennsylvania vote being

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:22.690
counted, the bigger Joe Biden's lead is actually
getting.

00:02:22.690 --> 00:02:27.780
It recently surpassed forty nine thousand
votes onward and beyond to fifty thousand

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:34.210
votes inching closer to Biden, winning Pennsylvania
by a full percentage point, putting it out

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:35.820
of recount territory.

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:36.820
But it doesn't matter.

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:38.720
Trump doesn't care.

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:39.720
Veterans Day.

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:40.720
It's about him.

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:42.010
It's all about him.

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:46.570
Trump also tweeting just before the start
of Veterans Day video from Fox News's Laura

00:02:46.570 --> 00:02:52.650
Ingraham Show promoting once again voter fraud,
conspiracy theories.

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:57.420
And this really shouldn't surprise us because
Donald Trump has never cared about veterans

00:02:57.420 --> 00:03:03.280
as people remember that during his presidency,
which will soon be over, Donald Trump cared

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:07.370
about using the VA as an example to claim
successes.

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:10.280
Many times Donald Trump claimed we did veterans
choice.

00:03:10.280 --> 00:03:14.130
In reality, that was Barack Obama's program
from 2014.

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:16.760
Trump cared about using soldiers as props.

00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:24.920
Trump even said during the coronavirus pandemic
that he continued to meet with military families,

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:26.890
Gold Star families during the pandemic.

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:28.440
What a great guy.

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:33.280
And he even suggested that it might have been
because he continued to meet with Gold Star

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:37.330
Families, that he caught Coronavirus maybe
from one of them.

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:39.610
He actually said that, if you can believe
it.

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:43.800
So what we're ultimately getting to hear is,
number one, this is the last Veterans Day

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:49.590
on which Donald Trump will do this as president
unless he runs in twenty four and wins.

00:03:49.590 --> 00:03:52.300
But we're not going to really deal with that
for the time being.

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:53.300
Few.

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:58.510
For veterans days, I do imagine Trump will
continue to tweet, I did more for veterans

00:03:58.510 --> 00:04:01.550
when I was president than anyone else or something
like that.

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:04.920
He'll still make it about himself in the future.

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:08.030
But the other thing which we're going to be
talking about today and on tomorrow's program

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:11.990
is that this entire voter fraud thing that
Donald Trump has been pushing, it's working

00:04:11.990 --> 00:04:13.190
in a few different ways.

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:15.590
He has convinced 86 percent of Republicans.

00:04:15.590 --> 00:04:17.560
We're going to look at the polling tomorrow.

